'''Akuma''' (豪鬼, ''Gōki'') is a [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemy that appears in the [[Street Fighter Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 8.10 Update#Update 8.10.5|Version 8.10.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Akuma
|image = E 488.png
|appearance = [[Street Fighter Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 1,000¢ - 3,950¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has high health and a long-range [[Multi-Hit]] attack, along with the [[Omni Strike]] ability. He is essentially a Dark counterpart to [[Dancer Cat (Enemy)|Dancer Cat]], with double the damage of said enemy and more range.

==Strategy==
Fast attackers that can sneak in hits are the best way to counter him, which includes [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev Cat]], [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]], [[Talents|Talented]] [[Cats in a Box (Special Cat)|Heavy Assault C.A.T.]], and the likes. Most traditional backliners are likely to get sniped by his Omni Strike, so don't bother with them. Notably, [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]] with Speed Up and Freeze [[Cat Combo]]s is one of the only crowd-controllers capable of holding him still. Take advantage of that!

